              "content": "*To learn more about calling atproto API endpoints like this one, see the [API Hosts and Auth](/docs/advanced-guides/api-directory) guide.*\n\nFind labels relevant to the provided AT-URI patterns. Public endpoint for moderation services, though may return different or additional results with auth.",
